default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-30T15:56:22Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T18:15:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIt has been confirmed that the issue occurred between versions 4.6.0-4.6.2, and other versions have not been tested.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen A references B and B references A, the ConfigFile will loop through the parameters of A and B until 'Max recurrence reached'.\n\n<img width=\"1062\" height=\"491\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/107acf13-0132-48b1-9d10-fa7952ae0eed\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1.Create an Node1 and reference Node2\n```\nextends Node\n@onready var Node2:Node = $\"../Node2\"\n```\n2.Create an Node2 and reference Node1\n```\nextends Node\n@onready var Node1:Node = $\"../Node1\"\n```\n3.Add Node1 or Node2 to the value of the ConfigFile\n```\nextends Node\nvar config:ConfigFile = ConfigFile.new()\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tconfig.set_value(\"section\", \"key\", $Node1)\n```\n4.config.encode_to_text()\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27249938/test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119121/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}